			"notes": "## [0.5-1.21.1] - 2025-12-29\n\n### Added\n\n- **Beer & Taverns:**\n    - **Drunk Effect:** Added a new status effect and related brewing recipes.\n    - **Interactions:** Added a \"spill\" action for beer mugs.\n    - **Music:** Added `OST_02 - Tavern Time (by Vahyard)`. This track now loops specifically when inside Taverns.\n    - **Trades:** Added more trades to the Barkeeper villager.\n- **Compatibility:**\n    - Added **JEI** compatibility.\n- **Cryptic Codex:**\n    - Added support for **Smithing Recipes**.\n    - Added a scroll bar to the category list.\n    - Added support for Data Components in item showcases.\n- **Sentience:**\n    - Added a **Googly Eyes** system to items.\n    - Added self-introduction capability for trinkets.\n- **Visuals:** \n    - Added an animation when using the **Cryptic Eye** for spells.\n\n### Changed\n\n- **Mug Placement:** Mugs can now only be placed when **crouching** (prevents accidental placement when trying to drink).\n- **Fuel:** Removed the Cryptic Eye from being used as furnace fuel.\n- **Documentation:** Updated the Codex content.\n\n## Stay Tuned for More Updates!\n\nCrawling Mysteries is currently in development.\n\n[0.5-1.21.1]: https://github.com/Larguma/crawling-mysteries/compare/0.4-1.21.1...0.5-1.21.1"
		},
