			"notes": "## [0.4-1.21.1] - 2025-12-24\n\n### Added\n\n- **World Generation:** Added a new **Tavern** structure that generates in the world.\n    - Includes custom loot tables for the Tavern chests.\n- **Mobs:** Added a **Barkeeper** villager variant.\n- **Items & Blocks:**\n    - Added **Beer Keg**, a block to refill your mug.\n    - Added **Beer Mug**, drinkable but only cosmetic for now.\n    - Added crafting recipes for all beer-related items.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- **Spells:** Fixed an issue where the \"unknown spell\" error appeared during quick cast.\n- **Cryptic Codex:** Fixed the content scroll position so it properly resets when changing pages.\n\n## Stay Tuned for More Updates!\n\nCrawling Mysteries is currently in development.\n\n[0.4-1.21.1]: https://github.com/Larguma/crawling-mysteries/compare/0.3-1.21.1...0.4-1.21.1"
		},
