			"notes": "## [0.3-1.21.1] - 2025-12-21\n\n### Added\n\n- **Lucky Horseshoe:** A new trinket equipped in the feet slot to negate fall damage.\n  - The standard version found in chests negates damage 50% of the time.\n  - It can be upgraded to provide a 100% chance to negate fall damage.\n- **Music:** The first OST track for the mod (Thanks to Vahyard).\n- **Config:** A new configuration parameter to disable all animations.\n- **Spells:** A \"Cast Last Used Spell\" keybind.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- **Cryptic Codex:** Fixed missing textures appearing before categories, entries, and titles.\n- **Animations:** Fixed animations being synced to client FPS.\n\n## Stay Tuned for More Updates!\n\nCrawling Mysteries is currently in development.\n\n[0.3-1.21.1]: https://github.com/Larguma/crawling-mysteries/compare/0.2-1.21.1...0.3-1.21.1"
		},
