			"notes": "## 0.2-1.21.1 - Neoforge\n\n## New Features\n\n### Cryptic Codex\n\n- In-Game Wiki!\n- Entries are written in JSON (datapacks) and fully translatable.\n- Dynamic categories, 6 page types (text, image, item showcase, spell info, crafting, entity display).\n- Check the README.\n\n### Eternal Guardian's Band\n\n- To unlock tombstone generation, you must now attune to your band by sucking the souls of other mobs.\n\n## Improvements\n\n### Tombstone\n\n- All your items should now return to their original slots when you retrieve your tombstone.\n\n## Stay Tuned for More Updates!\n\nCrawling Mysteries is currently in development.\n\n## Auto-generated\n\n### What's Changed\n* 0.2-1.21.1 by @Larguma in https://github.com/Larguma/crawling-mysteries/pull/2\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Larguma/crawling-mysteries/compare/0.1-1.21.1...0.2-1.21.1"
		},
